        "node_id": "n_6_4bd841",
        "thought_text": "Mathematical closed-form solution by summing deficits and dividing by k, ignoring the per-ingredient constraint that magic powder can only supplement missing amounts, not replace existing shortages entirely if logic is flawed, but actually this is incorrect because the bottleneck is the minimum ratio, not total sum.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "3847848223859350733",
        "replaces_revision_id": null,
        "feedback_id": null,
        "created_at": 1794557094.6851356
      },
      "rev_n_7_4c2ebc_0": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_7_4c2ebc_0",
        "node_id": "n_7_4c2ebc",
        "thought_text": "Binary search on the answer range [0, 2*10^18] with an O(n) feasibility check per step. For a target number of cookies x, calculate the deficit for each ingredient (max(0, a_i * x - b_i)) and sum them. If the total deficit is <= k, then x is achievable.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "4584558757923018312",
        "replaces_revision_id": null,
        "feedback_id": null,
        "created_at": 1794557121.8918633
